        "$description": "Font-size scale in px, as in the Figma primitives. The type set picks from it (2026-11-17): Text 12 to 20, headings 24 to 64, Display 80, 104, 128, 160 and 200. 10, 13, 15 and 36 are for UI and creatives.",
